        "raw": "<p>You resolve each sentance on the card in order. &nbsp;In the case of nimbke strike you would:</p><p>1. Deal 1 target 1 melee damage (resolving any damage buffs/reduction)</p><p>2. Draw a card.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">This can come in handy sometimes (or be annoying), especially when you have interactions that cause heroes to hurt themselves, or you have other effects that are dependant on you dealing damage.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here are a few examples:</p><p><strong>Promo (Freedom 6) Unity</strong></p><p>Unity deals herself 4 energy damage. &nbsp;Put a Mechanical golem from your hand into play.</p><p>First you deal damage (applying any buffs/reductions). &nbsp;then you play a golem. &nbsp; &nbsp;This can be pretty painful if Legacy has galvanized/inspiring presenced, but pretty sweet if you&#39;ve got some way to prevent damage to Unity (for instance, if she is entanged in Ensnaring Brambles, Ethereal bonds, or it was heroically intercepted.)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Hypersonic Assault:</strong></p><p>First you deal every non-hero 1 sonic damage. (resolving any redirections, reductions or buffs)</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Then, any target that was dealt damage can&#39;t deal damage (this effect is dependant on the target taking at least 1 point of damage, so whether you get through any armor in step 1 is VERY important).&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Stun bolt</strong></p><p>Deal 1 target 1 projectile damage (resolving reductions/buffs).</p><p>Reduce damage by that target by 1 (Note that this reduction is NOT dependant on the stun bolt gettign through armor!)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>hope this helps!</p>",
