        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It can be a bit tricky to figure out how some card text should be interpreted, given that you are sometimes expected to stop resolving rules text <em>in mid-sentence</em> (the classic example being Wrest the Mind...if Visionary kills the Wrested target with damage, she never deals any to herself), while other times, a card stays in play long enough to apply a when-destroyed effect (e.g. Sonic Mine or Explosives Wagon).&nbsp; In most cases, common sense is the correct answer, but this isn&#39;t always 100% reliable.</p>",
