      {
        "id": 87798,
        "name": "Sefirit",
        "username": "Sefirit",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-29T21:33:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is why my group will usually ask the questions:</p><p>Which way do we think is correct for the card?</p><p>Which way is correct for the situation?</p><p>Which way will result in the most fun/interesting situation?</p><p>Usually we go with what we think is right, but if it isn't clear we look at the next two questions.&nbsp; Being a cooperative game, and not being that competative a person anyway, I'm more interested in an enjoyable expereince than working everything 100% correctly.</p>",
