        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>This is why my group will usually ask the questions:</p><p>Which way do we think is correct for the card?</p><p>Which way is correct for the situation?</p><p>Which way will result in the most fun/interesting situation?</p><p>Usually we go with what we think is right, but if it isn&#39;t clear we look at the next two questions.&nbsp; Being a cooperative game, and not being that competative a person anyway, I&#39;m more interested in an enjoyable expereince than working everything 100% correctly.</p>",
